## Printed
heading: FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLES
heading: Can You Solve Them?
number: No 16
intro: Today's cross-word puzzle, the sixteenth in FUN'S series, was sent in by Miss Katherine Reilly, 332 East Fifty-sixth street, New York City. See if you can solve it. Fill in the small squares in the above diamond with words corresponding to the clews and definitions given below. On another page you will find the solution to last week's cross-word puzzle. The solution to today's puzzle will be given in next week's FUN.
credit: was sent in by Miss Katherine Reilly, 332 East Fifty-sixth street, New York City.


